WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
With grid supply available, the inverter can charge a battery and supply selected circuits.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.200
When the grid goes off, the inverter changes over to battery power for protected loads.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.800
When supply returns and stabilizes, the system resumes its normal operating mode.
